<title>UK: IMI Bank sets 75 million stg three-year bond.</title>
<headline>IMI Bank sets 75 million stg three-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers BZW and IMI Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   IMI BANK INTERNATIONAL</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  IMI SPA</p>
<p> AMT    75 MLN STG    COUPON     7.0	 MATURITY    21.FEB.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.9154  PAY DATE    21.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     REOFFER    99.7279   SPREAD	+35 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA3	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA-	 DENOMS (K) 100	 SALE LIMS US/UK/CY/IT</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.1875    SELL CONC  1.1875    PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.5 PCT 1999 GILT</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF AN EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
